// The positive control for the `pd` frame: the same initializer with a path
// inside `util`'s grant. The check the fix emits has to admit this, on both
// backends, or the fix would have broken every gated passdown initializer.
impl "util" caps(fs = ["/tmp/kelp_caps_pd_gated_granted/**"])

fun main() {
    print(util.show())
}
